==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's {{TCGP|Secluded Springs}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Expedition|Poliwag|125}} from the {{TCG|Expedition Base Set}}.
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Poliwag}}.
*'''Call for Family''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Jungle|Nidoran♀|57}} and {{TCG ID|Jungle|Bellsprout|49}}, both from the {{TCG|Jungle}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

